# AuroMind Git Attributes Configuration
# Standardize line endings to LF cross-platform while protecting binary assets

# Default text normalization
* text=auto eol=lf

# Image and media formats (strictly binary)
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.svg text eol=lf

# Fonts and audio (strictly binary)
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.eot binary
*.mp3 binary
*.wav binary
*.ogg binary

# Lockfiles and binary data
*.lock binary
*.pbtxt text eol=lf
